// Acoustic Guitar: part of dawsome-kit, committed as made.
// From dawsome-kit's acoustic guitar: Karoryfer Shinyguitar's recorded pluck driving a modelled steel string and body; CC0-1.0, see set.json.
// Uses only the SFZ opcodes Dawsome reads; keys are MIDI numbers (C4 = 60).

